    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/ae62276b87fbe4b56e3a8b89724af032.avif?t=1753298520\" data-has-big /></span><strong>EXPERIENCE A BREATHTAKING TECHNO-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ETRE</strong> is a <strong>3D Metroidvania</strong> adventure set in a luminous techno-fantasy world, blending layered exploration, deep storytelling, combat and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the one chosen by the Etre to chart a massive living <strong>labyrinth</strong>. Use the power of your <strong>mind</strong> to traverse vast spatial structures, combat and investigate strange machines, and immerse yourself in a story of emergence of a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/2a45f8e7c33bd7152aeb7feff4de3bd1.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span><strong>E</strong>XPLORE<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/8a3798b2c46c8bf23e1306d50b49266f.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/7bc508abc53eec4a6ef4ab80bf3559c4.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER THE STORIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/ae62276b87fbe4b56e3a8b89724af032.avif?t=1753298520\" data-has-big /></span><strong>EXPERIENCE A BREATHTAKING TECHNO-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ETRE</strong> is a <strong>3D Metroidvania</strong> adventure set in a luminous techno-fantasy world, blending layered exploration, deep storytelling, combat and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the one chosen by the Etre to chart a massive living <strong>labyrinth</strong>. Use the power of your <strong>mind</strong> to traverse vast spatial structures, combat and investigate strange machines, and immerse yourself in a story of emergence of a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/2a45f8e7c33bd7152aeb7feff4de3bd1.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span><strong>E</strong>XPLORE<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/8a3798b2c46c8bf23e1306d50b49266f.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/7bc508abc53eec4a6ef4ab80bf3559c4.avif?t=1753298520\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER THE STORIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
